{
    "title": "Bitcoin Miner Earn Real Crypto",
    "description": "Over 2,000,000 people are playing the ultimate bitcoin game!\r\n\r\nTap to discover and collect cryptocurrencies! Hire developers to create popular projects and then sell your portfolio for stronger GPUs in this addictive idle tycoon game. Evolve your coins, collect daily drops (airdrops) and invest in research to earn gold and collect as much real bitcoin as possible!\r\n\r\nPlease note: this game does not use your device to mine bitcoin. We send it from our revenue.\r\n\r\nTurn the countryside into a super Bitcoin mining farm venture. Sell your portfolio and reinvest it to become the next Bitcoin Billionaire! This is an idler, so your coins are always earning you $$$, even if you're not in the game!\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\u2022 Introducing a new type of idle, clicker or tycoon game that shares revenue with you!\r\n\u2022 Start with a pickaxe and turn an old farm into a lucrative crypto mining company!\r\n\u2022 Unlock 10 unique cryptocurrencies!\r\n\u2022 Visit new worlds and discover their secrets!\r\n\u2022 Open daily Airdrops and discover what's inside!\r\n\u2022 Constantly earn gold, even if you are offline!\r\n\u2022 No Internet Connection required to play!\r\n\r\nGot any problems or suggestions with our game? Join our Discord channel here: https://discord.gg/fumbgames \r\n\r\nHave fun! Fumb Games x\r\n\r\nLEGAL: \r\n\u2022 Contains optional in-app purchases (including random items) \r\n\u2022 The coins you earn in the game are dummy versions and have no real world value \r\n\u2022 Bitcoin rewards & withdrawals operated by a third party \r\n\u2022 Bitcoin Miner does not itself provide any cryptocurrency wallet or process any cryptocurrency transactions which are handled by a third party \r\n\u2022 Currently, our third party partner does not support withdrawals in Washington, Massachusetts, Florida, Hawaii, or New York \r\n\u2022 View our Privacy Policy: https://www.fumbgames.com/privacy-policy",
    "descriptionHTML": "Over 2,000,000 people are playing the ultimate bitcoin game!<br><br>Tap to discover and collect cryptocurrencies! Hire developers to create popular projects and then sell your portfolio for stronger GPUs in this addictive idle tycoon game. Evolve your coins, collect daily drops (airdrops) and invest in research to earn gold and collect as much real bitcoin as possible!<br><br>Please note: this game does not use your device to mine bitcoin. We send it from our revenue.<br><br>Turn the countryside into a super Bitcoin mining farm venture. Sell your portfolio and reinvest it to become the next Bitcoin Billionaire! This is an idler, so your coins are always earning you $$$, even if you&#39;re not in the game!<br><br>FEATURES:<br>\u2022 Introducing a new type of idle, clicker or tycoon game that shares revenue with you!<br>\u2022 Start with a pickaxe and turn an old farm into a lucrative crypto mining company!<br>\u2022 Unlock 10 unique cryptocurrencies!<br>\u2022 Visit new worlds and discover their secrets!<br>\u2022 Open daily Airdrops and discover what&#39;s inside!<br>\u2022 Constantly earn gold, even if you are offline!<br>\u2022 No Internet Connection required to play!<br><br>Got any problems or suggestions with our game? Join our Discord channel here: https://discord.gg/fumbgames <br><br>Have fun! Fumb Games x<br><br>LEGAL: <br>\u2022 Contains optional in-app purchases (including random items) <br>\u2022 The coins you earn in the game are dummy versions and have no real world value <br>\u2022 Bitcoin rewards &amp; withdrawals operated by a third party <br>\u2022 Bitcoin Miner does not itself provide any cryptocurrency wallet or process any cryptocurrency transactions which are handled by a third party <br>\u2022 Currently, our third party partner does not support withdrawals in Washington, Massachusetts, Florida, Hawaii, or New York <br>\u2022 View our Privacy Policy: https://www.fumbgames.com/privacy-policy",
